0869, 'eval_count': 916, 'eval_duration': 15419987913, 'model_name': 'qwen2.5:14b'} id='run--46133c6f-2f21-44e3-b93b-97e66a90d69e-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 984, 'output_tokens': 916, 'total_tokens': 1900}
